WEBVTT

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.270
Thank you for having us.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.920
Thanks, Honda-chan!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.940
Honda-san, just rough is fine,
but by the end of this week,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.680
can you try drawing the characters'
full bodies and some expressions?

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:43.620
That's what Seki-senpai asked me
to do at the end of our overnighter.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:47.540
But expressions are hard, so
I can't make them look cute.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.650
The childhood friend and Illustration
Club member who usually helps me…

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.980
Yumine, say…

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:54.600
Sorry.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:00.010
Sorry, yesterday's Haru Juku
was seriously a god-tier episode.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:04.580
I was posting about ships
until five in the morning…

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.260
Apparently feels unwell today.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:48.550
An original character
with an expression that's full of life…

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.220
so how do I draw it?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.020
Honda-san! What are you doing?
Let me join in!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.430
This is Shimizu Marika-san.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.560
She's my half-foreign classmate.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.100
You're drawing?

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.410
Honda-san, do you draw manga?

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.000
Well… sort of…

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:15.240
You looked down, but is it one of those creator's blocks?

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.960
Nothing that lofty.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.990
I'll be happy to help!

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:24.080
Drawing a likeness can help, right?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.250
It feels like she's making fun of me.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:36.800
If you liven up their expressions,
they'd look more like game characters.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.340
Liven up?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.000
Wow, you sound so professional.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:44.480
Do you draw manga too, Fuda-san?

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.490
I specialize in illustrations.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:51.500
Wow! So both of you
could be famous someday.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:53.990
Oh dear…

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:55.450
What's wrong, Honda-san?

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.880
Hey, don't tease her by being glib.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.080
Are you okay, Honda-san?

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:03.470
I think so.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:09.310
Iino Natsu-san is also a classmate.
She loves pets.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:13.340
Oh yeah, Honda-san… you're in that
club with the long name.

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.210
Something about fish?

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:18.760
Some Dead Fish Eyes,
Not Enough Sunlight, Shuttle Run Club.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:21.090
We create our own games.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.220
Awesome! You can make games?!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:27.480
Small ones called doujin games.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.560
“Doujin?”

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:33.520
Last night, I tried playing a game
made by the older members again.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.860
But when it comes to drawing,
I can't get the hang of it.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:40.930
That won't do. You mustn't
play games for more than an hour.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.830
That's true, I guess…

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:51.460
But I felt as though
I was on the verge of something…

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.600
so I ended up doodling in class.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.680
Okay, Honda-san, you take the next section.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:01.930
Honda-san?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.970
Um… one year after the revolution,
the Bill of Rights was enacted…

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.490
We just finished that.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.410
I-I'm sorry.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.150
Please pay attention.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:12.940
Yes.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.880
Ah… I don't know what came over me…

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:23.840
You mustn't doodle in history. Faces of historical figures will get mixed with doodles in your head.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.660
Ye... yeah...

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.130
During lunch, I was going to
ask Yumine what she thought.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.980
She's sleeping again.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:39.760
Look, Iino-san! I bought a shoujo manga for the first time in a while!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.140
This heroine tries to help loads of people.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:47.700
And she helps this not-too-brave boy
with his love problem.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.980
I wish I could be like that!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.160
You mustn't bring manga to class.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:56.800
Wrong! That character… Rensuke is
a beast and a sasoi-uke.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.360
Anyone would think so when they read
chapter 16 in the previous volume.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.410
And in fact, how dare you start
god-tier MajiRoma from volume 3!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.000
She didn't seem to be in
the mood to give advice.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.840
So I left school without
having solved a thing.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:28.060
How am I supposed to draw
characters that look lively?

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.180
I haven't found any clues.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:34.730
Oh, what should I do?

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:36.880
Oh, I forgot.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:39.820
Grandma made me candy.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.360
Homemade lollipops.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:50.120
Maybe the trick is to exaggerate
the happy face at times like this.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.520
Thanks for the food!

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:05.590
I dropped one. Sorry, Grandma.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.730
Today's not my day, it seems.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:17.610
Not good. I'm just no good.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:19.780
A cat…

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.610
I wish I were a cat.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.580
Nyaa…

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:25.780
Nyaa…

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.270
Nyaa… nyaa?

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.280
Nyaa-nyaa!

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.670
I made myself look silly
in front of a stranger.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:47.430
Hello, Kitten.
Say "nyaa" again, it was cute!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:49.140
Ny- Hello.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:52.860
You looked awfully sad,
but don't let a lollipop get you down.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.580
It's not just that. I mean…

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.270
Things aren't going well today,
like doing what I was asked to do.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.300
I'm not sure what to do.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.200
Kitten, your legs are so thin!

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.070
Are you eating properly?
You need more nutrition!

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:11.300
Oh, she's not listening to me.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.910
You can't draw well?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:15.760
Yes.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.250
And a friend made fun of me.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.380
Oh yeah, call me Teru.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:23.840
I won't tease, so don't worry.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:27.840
Then I'll model for you
to help you draw well.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.930
She's making fun of me too!

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.030
I'm dead serious.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:41.480
As a matter of fact, I'm pretty
keen on drawing too.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:42.790
Is that so?

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.200
Let me take a look.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.040
Oh, are you…

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.370
What is it?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.970
It's nothing.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.930
Anyway, I'll take this.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:02.850
And in exchange, I'll cast a spell
to cheer you up!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.590
I'm not sure why,
but she treated me at a cafe.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.890
What's going on?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:17.280
My college friend told me about
this place. The pancakes are delicious!

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:20.650
So eat up, Kitten,
and put on some weight.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:23.700
Um… can I have it back?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:27.280
My friends and senpai
helped me with it. It means a lot.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.000
Why?

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:36.080
Creating a game is really difficult,
so why do you put in the work for it?

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.540
Do you draw because you're forced to?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.130
I…

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.920
I wanted to change
my aimless self…

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:49.310
And… if you set the blend mode to “multiply,”

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:55.780
I just want to make this a club where
none of you will get bored.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.990
Please prioritize finishing the game.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:03.590
I think it'd be good to expand on
hearing the voices of things.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.400
STOP!!!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.590
That's not it!

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.650
I'll practice what I was taught
for a little while longer.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.140
No, that's not it.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.830
When we did things like the overnighter,

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:25.120
I thought creating things together was fun.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:28.190
That's why, that's…

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:38.410
Good!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.360
Put that passion into it and
I'm sure you'll create something great.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.830
I'm looking forward to it.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.090
I feel like I got pinched by a fox.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.970
Say…

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.990
Did I mention I was working on a game?

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.040
Oh, Honda-san?

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.670
What are you doing here?

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:09.920
Iino-san!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:14.840
I'm not sure myself, but I went to a cafe
with someone I met by the river.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.640
What?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:19.310
Didn't your parents teach you
not to go places with strangers?

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.320
Now that you mention it, yes.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.900
Welcome!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.480
Nyaa!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.980
T-Teru-senpai?!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:34.840
Oh! You recognized me even in my disguse?
You've grown, Fuyon-chan.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.870
Please quit calling me that.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:43.040
Actually, I came to
talk to you today, Fuyon-chan.

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.750
You still don't listen
to what people say.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:51.300
Here's a contribution
from your kind senpai.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:52.880
Huh? Money?

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:57.650
I met cute kitten and want to
make a donation. Use it wisely.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.640
Thank you!

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.530
But why all of a sudden?
What do you mean by a “kitten?”

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:08.350
Please speak in human language!

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.950
They'll be here soon.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:18.730
Okay.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:23.340
Hey!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.620
Thanks for coming
to this side of the tracks.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.560
Thank you for inviting us.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.000
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.960
Oh, we didn't wait at all.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.130
Say…

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:38.590
Can you stop those sudden
bomb blast effects?

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.660
Next we're going to
the electronics shop, was it?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:51.610
Yes, we'll buy a scanner so you can
get your drawings onto a PC.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.630
Seki-san, did you bring the club funds?

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.370
Huh?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.940
We used the budget up in April.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.700
I thought you were paying today.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.780
What? That's news to me.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.500
N-no!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.770
Papa told me advances on
my allowance aren't allowed.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.590
Papa's word is absolute!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.340
Out of the question, huh?

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:17.810
Just kidding! I actually got
a donation from an old member.

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:19.760
What? From Teru-senpai?

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:24.100
She said she met a cute kitten,
so she's donating to the club.

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.310
Teru-senpai is the same as ever.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:29.140
Kitten…

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.840
I'm taking this, Kitten!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.480
That weird encounter the other day…

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.570
Oh, what did she say her name was?

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.660
My mind was on my sketchbook,
so I don't remember.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.840
What's the matter?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.740
I think this one's right for us.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:49.330
Oh yeah. It's pretty standard
and easy to use.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.290
Honda-chan, how about it?

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.340
I'll do my best to
learn to use it quickly.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:58.480
You just stick paper in.
They're not hard to use.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.470
I left my sketchbook
at the shop! I have to go get it!

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.850
Please wait here!

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:10.390
S-sure.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.320
Honda-san?!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:20.780
It started to rain.
But the sketchbook is safe.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:21.900
Never mind that!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.700
You'll catch a cold!

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:27.160
Thank goodness
your house was near, Aya.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.950
Excuse us!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.300
Come in. Don't mind
my noisy brothers though.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.110
Here, Onee-chan. Towels!

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:36.130
Good boy, Nobuhito.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.960
Aneki, I'm hungry!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.880
Quiet! Can't you see we're busy?

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.300
Dry your hair thoroughly.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.840
Thank you!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.780
What's up, Haruma?

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.940
Ah. N-Nothing.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.730
What's a grade schooler doing with you?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.810
Idiot! Honda-san is older than you.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:55.560
Older?

00:14:55.750 --> 00:15:00.030
She's in middle school?!
I figured she's about my age.

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.570
Wait here until the bath is ready.

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:06.120
This is my… rather, our room.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:06.950
Sure.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:14.160
Oh, yeah! Haruma is good at art too.

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.760
Wow! Such pretty colors.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.940
You don't have to
be embarrassed, you know.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.620
Can you teach me how to draw too?

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:30.950
This kid brother…

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.000
Oh my...

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.730
Whoa, it spreads more than I thought.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:41.820
Spread the color in wider strokes,
then work from the lighter areas.

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.360
The bath is ready.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:45.400
O-okay!

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.980
It'll be uneven if you don't
cover it in one go.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.530
Not like that…

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.620
Are you going to be all right?
This is basic knowledge.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.670
I-I'll try my best.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:59.790
You're so kind to teach me.
I'm so sorry.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.090
N-no, I…

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.130
You reap what you sow.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.800
How interesting!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:24.860
She needs a change of clothes.
I hope mine will fit.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:27.750
I'm sure it will.
You're just as flat-chested.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.220
Oh? You're dissing Honda-san's size?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.420
I'm gonna tell her.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.060
If you do, I'll show Dad
your black notebook.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.210
Not that!

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.000
That's got nothing to do with this!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.550
You're the one being unfair!

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:45.840
Shut up, midget!

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:46.930
You chuuni!

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.580
Shii, they're fighting.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:50.800
It's okay. I'll stop them.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.600
I'll leave clothes here.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:58.390
Start from the light areas.
Spread the color, evening it out.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.000
And…

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.520
You okay, Honda-san?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.520
Oh! Yes, I'm fine.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:07.090
If you think you'll forget what you
were told, why not jot it down?

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.950
Oh, I will!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.620
Okay!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.510
Bundle up so you don't get cold.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.940
Are you listening?

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:19.180
Yes!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.710
Is this okay? This is hard.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.130
You draw great!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.940
Thank you, Nobuhito-kun.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:33.550
Um, if I color on paper like this,
is it okay to use it for the game?

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:36.350
It'll probably give it a unique style.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:39.520
Haruma-kun, can you see if
I colored it correctly?

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.400
I don't really care.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.130
What kind of answer is that?

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.230
Oh, what happened to your forehead?

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.990
I took a flick to it.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:49.540
Lame!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.240
Your face too, Aneki.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.740
Well, yeah.
She didn't hold back.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:00.140
Just now, I was drawing…
Huh? It's gone.

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.300
I'm sorry, I'm borrowing it.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.640
Shall we try to put those drawings
into the game? As placeholders?

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.420
Eh? Already?

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.720
What? We'll get to see it so quick?

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:12.930
Oh, I'm not ready for this…

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.560
I wanna see it!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:19.360
O-okay! Please do it!

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:26.940
Huh? Using analog coloring looks
okay for a game too.

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.000
Guess so.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.570
It's uneven,
and the main lines are sloppy.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:34.800
This kid…

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.260
Here's the next one, Samyu.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.210
Hey, not bad.

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.120
And the selection window old man?

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.540
Oh, he's not ready.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.340
Ah, he's still a work in progress, huh.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:56.380
He's an original character, after all.
Honda-chan will have to design him for us.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.060
You're right...

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:02.100
But drawing the expressions for
a cool old man is hard.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.360
I've been mulling over
how to draw him.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.940
You're stuck over something that simple?

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:13.610
The more I thought about it,
the harder it gets to picture it clearly.

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:17.660
You can't just think about it.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.540
Look for reference material like this.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:27.540
And look for what you can use as
a base when you're out and about.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.440
If you're going to draw, you have to
properly observe all kinds of things.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.560
O-of course!
I didn't think of that.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:37.180
You're actually good for something!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.070
It's the most basic of the basics.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.800
I see…

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:46.080
I can look for someone who fits how
I imagine him to use as my model…

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.190
Thank you, Haruma-kun!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.180
But don't copy it directly.

00:19:56.180 --> 00:20:00.160
It's only a hint or model.
There's stuff like image rights.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.290
I know! Thank you, thank you!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.340
He's blushing.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.000
This is so interesting.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:12.920
This way, even I may be able
to draw a lively expression.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:21.580
That's right! She was giving me hints too.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.440
Ah. Papa?

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.730
You're coming to pick me up?

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.980
She was welcome to stay for dinner.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.360
Apparently she's homesick.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.360
When's he coming?
I can't wait to show him.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:40.990
Oh hey, Honda-chan…
is there a boy you like?

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:41.720
Huh?

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:43.580
What kind of question is that?!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.200
Just curious.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.250
The only guy in my life right now is my papa.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:51.880
He said he'll look at today's
drawings when we get home.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.460
So you're close to your dad, huh?

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.900
So you like older men, Honda-chan?

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:02.900
Pretty rare to find a first year in high school
still so lovey-dovey with her dad.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:05.770
Really? Isn't it normal?

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:08.440
She's in high school…

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.370
Huh? What's bugging you now?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.070
Thank you for everything.

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.280
Good night.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.530
See you tomorrow.

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:31.290
So you see, first loves usually
don't lead to anything.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:32.790
Just forget about her.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:36.800
You're one to talk. You've never
even had a boyfriend.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:40.520
That's 'cuz I'm not interested
in that stuff!

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.970
No one's even asked you out!

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:44.010
Shut up, midget!

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:44.970
You chuuni!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.850
Shii, they're at it again.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:49.500
Indeed. You'll have your dinner soon.

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:24.440
Honda-san fainted!

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:26.370
Please don't leave me, Senpai!

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:28.420
Oh, whatever!
What will be will be!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.240
We had fun working
to create this together!
